"If Spotify says “Invalid redirect URI”, add {uri} to your registration "
"exactly, save, and sign in again."
msgstr ""
"Si Spotify dice «Invalid redirect URI», añade {uri} a tu registro tal cual, "
"guarda y vuelve a iniciar sesión."

#: src/ui/login.rs:360
msgid "Sign in with Spotify"
msgstr "Iniciar sesión con Spotify"

#: src/ui/login.rs:371
msgid ""
"Sign in through your browser. Spotifast never sees your password. Local "
"playback needs Spotify Premium."
msgstr ""
"Inicia sesión desde tu navegador. Spotifast nunca ve tu contraseña. La "
"reproducción local necesita Spotify Premium."

#: src/ui/login.rs:380
msgid "How to register Spotifast"
msgstr "Cómo registrar Spotifast"

#: src/ui/login.rs:404
msgid "Proxy Settings"
msgstr "Ajustes del proxy"

#: src/ui/login.rs:454
msgid ""
"A Client ID is 32 letters and digits. Copy it from Spotify's developer "
"dashboard."
msgstr ""
"Un Client ID tiene 32 letras y números. Cópialo del panel de desarrolladores "
"de Spotify."

#: src/ui/login.rs:514
msgid ""
"Spotify asks you to register Spotifast once, on an account with Premium. It "
"takes about two minutes and gives you a Client ID."
msgstr ""
"Spotify te pide registrar Spotifast una vez, en una cuenta con Premium. "
"Lleva unos dos minutos y te da un Client ID."

